    "background_story": "Gage was a charismatic entrepreneur with a reputation for being a man of his word. In the cutthroat world of finance, he stood out for his unwavering integrity and willingness to vouch for those he believed in. When his friend and business partner, Rachel, was struggling to secure funding for her startup, Gage stepped in to vouch for her character and vision. He put his own reputation on the line, convincing skeptical investors to take a chance on her innovative idea. Thanks to Gage's endorsement, Rachel's company flourished, and she never forgot the debt of gratitude she owed him. As Gage's network of connections grew, so did his influence, and he became known as the go-to guy for entrepreneurs seeking guidance and support. His willingness to vouch for others had created a ripple effect of trust and prosperity in the business community.",
